wine.inf: give new bottles placeholder atidxx64, nvapi64 and nvngx DLLs.

CrossOver hack 22435, as in the wine.inf of engine c2 (Sikarugir 10.0_6) but not
in CrossOver 25.1.1's source. With a placeholder in system32, a game that loads
one of these gets D3DMetal's (AMD's driver extension, NVAPI, DLSS on MetalFX)
through WINEDLLPATH_PREPEND; without one, Wine doesn't find it. LGPL-2.1, like Wine.

--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -2161,6 +2161,10 @@
 [FakeDllsWin64]
 10,twain_64,sane.ds
 10,twain_64,gphoto2.ds
+; CW HACK 22435: fake DLLs for D3DMetal
+11,,atidxx64.dll,*
+11,,nvapi64.dll,*
+11,,nvngx.dll,*
 
 ; Wow64-only fake dlls
 [FakeDllsWow64]
